  "text": "## Template 4: Successful Transfer Confirmation  \n**Subject:** Your Transfer of £[amount] Is Complete ✓  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nYour transfer has been successfully processed.\n\nTransfer Details:\n- Amount: £[amount]\n- From: Your SmartSaver (ending in [XXXX])\n- To: [Recipient Name] ([Bank] Account)\n- Date Sent: [date and time]\n- Status: COMPLETED\n\nYour New Balance:\n£[new balance] (after this transfer)\n\nQuestions About This Transfer?\nIf you didn't authorize this transfer or have concerns, contact\nus immediately:\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265 (24/7 fraud line)\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n\nView Your Account:\nLog in at www.firstuk.bank/login to see all your transactions.\n\nThank you,\nFirstUK Bank Team\n```  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 6/15",
